{"seq":3,"slug":"color-contrast-visual-adaptation","title":"颜色对比度与视觉适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns/color-contrast-visual-adaptation","wordCount":2291,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"颜色对比度与视觉适配\">颜色对比度与视觉适配</h1><p>颜色是移动界面信息传达的重要通道，但约 3 亿人存在色觉缺陷（色盲/色弱），更大范围的低视力人群（包括老年性视力下降）依赖足够的对比度来感知内容。WCAG 的对比度要求不是审美约束而是信息可达性保障——对比度不足意味着内容对相当比例的用户「不存在」。工程层面需要理解对比度计算原理、建立系统化的色彩无障碍策略，并与平台暗色模式和高对比度模式正确集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>对比度比值（Contrast Ratio）</strong>：两个颜色之间的亮度比，范围 1:1 到 21:1，由 WCAG 相对亮度公式计算</li>\n<li><strong>相对亮度（Relative Luminance）</strong>：sRGB 色彩空间中颜色的感知亮度值，考虑人眼对绿色敏感度最高的特性</li>\n<li><strong>WCAG 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast</strong>：对 UI 组件和图形元素（非文本）要求最低 3:1 对比度的 AA 级准则</li>\n<li><strong>语义颜色（Semantic Colors）</strong>：平台提供的按功能命名的颜色，在 Light/Dark 模式下自动切换以保证对比度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"对比度计算原理与标准\">对比度计算原理与标准</h2><p>WCAG 定义的对比度（Contrast Ratio）基于相对亮度（Relative Luminance）计算。两个颜色的对比度比值范围为 1:1（完全相同）到 21:1（纯黑 vs 纯白）。</p>\n<p><strong>相对亮度计算公式</strong>：</p>\n<p>对于 sRGB 色彩空间中的颜色 (R, G, B)，各通道值从 0-255 归一化到 0-1 后进行 gamma 解码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2126</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.7152</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0722</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 0.2126 \\times R_{lin} + 0.7152 \\times G_{lin} + 0.0722 \\times B_{lin}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2126</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7152</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0722</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中线性化通道值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{lin}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的计算为：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.04045</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sRGB} \\leq 0.04045</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04045</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12.92</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{lin} = C_{sRGB} / 12.92</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/12.92</span></span></span></span></span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.055</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1.055</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2.4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{lin} = ((C_{sRGB} + 0.055) / 1.055)^{2.4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">GB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.055</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/1.055</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>对比度比值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR = (L_1 + 0.05) / (L_2 + 0.05)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为较亮色的亮度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为较暗色的亮度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[前景色 RGB] --&gt; B[Gamma 解码线性化]&#10;    C[背景色 RGB] --&gt; D[Gamma 解码线性化]&#10;    B --&gt; E[计算相对亮度 L1]&#10;    D --&gt; F[计算相对亮度 L2]&#10;    E --&gt; G[对比度比值 CR]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{达标判定}&#10;    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 4.5:1| I[AA 正文通过]&#10;    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 3:1| J[AA 大文本/UI 通过]&#10;    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 7:1| K[AAA 增强通过]&#10;    H --&gt;|CR &lt; 3:1| L[不合格]\">graph TD\n    A[前景色 RGB] --&gt; B[Gamma 解码线性化]\n    C[背景色 RGB] --&gt; D[Gamma 解码线性化]\n    B --&gt; E[计算相对亮度 L1]\n    D --&gt; F[计算相对亮度 L2]\n    E --&gt; G[对比度比值 CR]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{达标判定}\n    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 4.5:1| I[AA 正文通过]\n    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 3:1| J[AA 大文本/UI 通过]\n    H --&gt;|CR ≥ 7:1| K[AAA 增强通过]\n    H --&gt;|CR &lt; 3:1| L[不合格]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WCAG 准则</th>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>最低对比度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.4.3 Contrast (Minimum)</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n<td>正文文本（&lt;18pt / &lt;14pt bold）</td>\n<td>4.5:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.3</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n<td>大文本（≥18pt / ≥14pt bold）</td>\n<td>3:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.11 Non-text Contrast</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n<td>UI 组件和图形对象</td>\n<td>3:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.6 Contrast (Enhanced)</td>\n<td>AAA</td>\n<td>正文文本</td>\n<td>7:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.4.6</td>\n<td>AAA</td>\n<td>大文本</td>\n<td>4.5:1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>移动端特殊考量</strong>：在户外强光环境下，屏幕实际可见对比度远低于设计稿中的理论值。移动设备的使用场景比桌面设备更多样——阳光直射、低亮度省电模式、反光——这意味着工程实践中应以 AA 为底线、以 AAA 为目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色觉缺陷适配策略\">色觉缺陷适配策略</h2><p>色觉缺陷分为三大类型：红色盲/红色弱（Protanopia/Protanomaly，约 6% 男性）、绿色盲/绿色弱（Deuteranopia/Deuteranomaly，约 5% 男性）、蓝色盲/蓝色弱（Tritanopia/Tritanomaly，极罕见）。WCAG 1.4.1 要求颜色不能作为传达信息的唯一手段。</p>\n<p><strong>工程原则：颜色 + 第二通道</strong>：</p>\n<p>任何通过颜色传达的信息必须同时通过至少一个非颜色通道传达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息类型</th>\n<th>颜色表达</th>\n<th>第二通道方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误状态</td>\n<td>红色文字/边框</td>\n<td>错误图标 + 文字说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成功状态</td>\n<td>绿色勾选</td>\n<td>勾选图标 + 文字「成功」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必填字段</td>\n<td>红色星号</td>\n<td>星号 + 文字标注「必填」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表数据系列</td>\n<td>不同颜色线条</td>\n<td>不同线型（实线/虚线/点线）+ 标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接文本</td>\n<td>蓝色</td>\n<td>下划线或加粗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签分类</td>\n<td>彩色标签</td>\n<td>颜色 + 图标 + 文字</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 不合格设计&#10;        A[红色=错误] --&gt; B[仅靠颜色区分]&#10;        B --&gt; C[红色盲用户无法识别]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 合格设计&#10;        D[红色+图标+文字] --&gt; E[颜色+形状+语义]&#10;        E --&gt; F[所有用户可识别]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 不合格设计\n        A[红色=错误] --&gt; B[仅靠颜色区分]\n        B --&gt; C[红色盲用户无法识别]\n    end\n    subgraph 合格设计\n        D[红色+图标+文字] --&gt; E[颜色+形状+语义]\n        E --&gt; F[所有用户可识别]\n    end</pre><p><strong>色板验证流程</strong>：在设计色板阶段就应进行色觉模拟验证。iOS 模拟器的 Accessibility Inspector 提供色觉缺陷模拟；Android Studio 的 Layout Inspector 同样提供色盲模拟滤镜。第三方工具如 Stark（Figma 插件）可以在设计阶段验证色板的色觉安全性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暗色模式的无障碍集成\">暗色模式的无障碍集成</h2><p>暗色模式（Dark Mode）不仅是视觉偏好——对于光敏性用户和部分低视力用户，暗色模式能显著降低视觉疲劳和眩光。但暗色模式下的对比度设计有其独特挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>暗色模式对比度陷阱</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纯白文字 (#FFFFFF) 在纯黑背景 (#000000) 上虽然对比度达到 21:1（最大值），但长时间阅读会产生「光晕效应」（Halation），对散光用户造成字形模糊</li>\n<li>推荐使用稍低纯度的浅色（如 #E0E0E0 约 15.3:1）代替纯白</li>\n<li>暗色模式的背景应使用深灰（#1C1C1E）而非纯黑，既保持高对比度又避免光晕</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>平台主题适配</strong>：</p>\n<p>iOS 使用 Semantic Colors（如 <code>.label</code>、<code>.secondaryLabel</code>、<code>.systemBackground</code>）在 Light/Dark 模式下自动切换。开发者使用语义颜色而非硬编码 RGB 值，系统保证在两种模式下都满足对比度要求。</p>\n<p>Android 使用 Material Theme 的颜色角色系统（<code>colorOnSurface</code>、<code>colorOnPrimary</code> 等），在 Light/Dark Theme 间自动映射。使用 Material Design 3 的 Dynamic Color 时，系统生成的配色方案已内置对比度保证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>推荐文字颜色</th>\n<th>推荐背景颜色</th>\n<th>对比度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Light</td>\n<td>#1C1C1E</td>\n<td>#FFFFFF</td>\n<td>18.1:1</td>\n<td>接近纯黑但更柔和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dark</td>\n<td>#E0E0E0</td>\n<td>#1C1C1E</td>\n<td>12.4:1</td>\n<td>避免纯白光晕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dark (Secondary)</td>\n<td>#A0A0A0</td>\n<td>#1C1C1E</td>\n<td>6.1:1</td>\n<td>次要文本仍达 AA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High Contrast</td>\n<td>#000000</td>\n<td>#FFFFFF</td>\n<td>21:1</td>\n<td>仅限高对比度模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高对比度模式与系统级适配\">高对比度模式与系统级适配</h2><p>iOS 和 Android 都提供系统级的高对比度（Increase Contrast / High Contrast）设置，供低视力用户进一步增强界面对比度。</p>\n<p><strong>iOS Increase Contrast</strong>：通过 <code>UIAccessibility.isDarkerSystemColorsEnabled</code> 或 SwiftUI 的 <code>@Environment(\\.colorSchemeContrast)</code> 检测。系统 UI 自动响应——分隔线加深、半透明效果减弱、控件边框增强。自定义 UI 应当提供高对比度变体。</p>\n<p><strong>Android High Contrast Text</strong>：系统通过给文字描边来增强可读性，对应用透明。但自定义绘制的文本需要开发者自行检测 <code>Settings.Secure.ACCESSIBILITY_HIGH_TEXT_CONTRAST_ENABLED</code> 并实现对应效果。</p>\n<p><strong>智能色彩降级策略</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[检测系统对比度偏好] --&gt; B{偏好级别}&#10;    B --&gt;|标准| C[使用默认色板]&#10;    B --&gt;|增强| D[切换高对比度色板]&#10;    B --&gt;|减弱| E[降低对比度/减少视觉刺激]&#10;    C --&gt; F[对比度 ≥ 4.5:1]&#10;    D --&gt; G[对比度 ≥ 7:1]&#10;    E --&gt; H[保持 ≥ 3:1 底线]&#10;    F --&gt; I[渲染]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[检测系统对比度偏好] --&gt; B{偏好级别}\n    B --&gt;|标准| C[使用默认色板]\n    B --&gt;|增强| D[切换高对比度色板]\n    B --&gt;|减弱| E[降低对比度/减少视觉刺激]\n    C --&gt; F[对比度 ≥ 4.5:1]\n    D --&gt; G[对比度 ≥ 7:1]\n    E --&gt; H[保持 ≥ 3:1 底线]\n    F --&gt; I[渲染]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"非文本元素的对比度要求\">非文本元素的对比度要求</h2><p>WCAG 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast（AA 级）要求 UI 组件和图形元素的关键视觉边界与相邻颜色的对比度至少为 3:1。这影响：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>表单控件边框</strong>：输入框的边框颜色与背景的对比度 ≥ 3:1</li>\n<li><strong>按钮外观</strong>：按钮的边界或填充色与页面背景的对比度 ≥ 3:1</li>\n<li><strong>图标</strong>：传达信息的图标与背景的对比度 ≥ 3:1</li>\n<li><strong>焦点指示器</strong>：焦点框/环与背景的对比度 ≥ 3:1</li>\n<li><strong>图表元素</strong>：数据可视化中关键图形元素的相邻对比度 ≥ 3:1</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>状态变化的对比度</strong>：控件的不同状态（默认、悬停、按下、聚焦、禁用）之间也应有足够的视觉差异。禁用状态通常降低透明度，但不能降低到完全不可见——即使是禁用的控件也需要让用户知道「这里有个东西但当前不可用」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素类型</th>\n<th align=\"center\">最低对比度要求</th>\n<th>常见违规</th>\n<th>修复方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入框边框</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3:1</td>\n<td>浅灰边框在白色背景上（1.5:1）</td>\n<td>加深边框色或加底色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ghost 按钮</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3:1</td>\n<td>浅色边框无填充</td>\n<td>增加边框粗度或填充色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占位文本</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.5:1</td>\n<td>极浅灰色占位文本</td>\n<td>加深占位文本颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图标（信息性）</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3:1</td>\n<td>灰色图标在浅灰背景上</td>\n<td>增加图标色深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开关控件轨道</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3:1</td>\n<td>关闭态轨道与背景同色</td>\n<td>添加边框或加深轨道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点指示器</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3:1</td>\n<td>细线浅色焦点环</td>\n<td>加粗 + 加深或使用双色方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程验证工具与自动化\">工程验证工具与自动化</h2><p>对比度验证应集成到开发流程的多个阶段：设计时验证色板、开发时实时检测、提交时自动化门控。</p>\n<p><strong>设计阶段工具</strong>：Figma 的 Stark 插件、A11y Color Contrast Checker 可以在设计稿中直接验证任意两色组合的对比度，并标注不合格项。</p>\n<p><strong>开发阶段工具</strong>：Xcode Accessibility Inspector 的 Color Contrast Calculator 可以拾取屏幕任意两点的颜色并计算对比度。Android Studio 的 Accessibility Scanner 在运行时扫描整个视图树并报告对比度不足的元素。</p>\n<p><strong>CI 自动化</strong>：通过截图对比工具（如 snapshot testing 框架）结合像素分析，可以在 CI 中自动检测界面元素的对比度变化。当新提交导致某些元素对比度降低到阈值以下时自动失败。</p>\n<p>关于触控目标在不同视觉模式下的尺寸保证，参见 <a href=\"touch-target-gestures\">触控目标与手势适配</a> 的相关讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>色彩无障碍的工程要点：理解并使用 WCAG 对比度计算公式验证所有文字/UI 色彩组合；确保颜色永远不是传达信息的唯一通道（配合图标、文字、线型等第二通道）；使用平台语义颜色系统自动适配 Light/Dark 模式；响应系统高对比度偏好提供增强色板；暗色模式避免纯白文字导致的光晕效应；非文本 UI 元素同样需要 3:1 最低对比度。将对比度验证集成到设计阶段（Figma 插件）和 CI 阶段（像素分析）实现全流程覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"颜色对比度与视觉适配","id":"颜色对比度与视觉适配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度计算原理与标准","id":"对比度计算原理与标准"},{"level":2,"text":"色觉缺陷适配策略","id":"色觉缺陷适配策略"},{"level":2,"text":"暗色模式的无障碍集成","id":"暗色模式的无障碍集成"},{"level":2,"text":"高对比度模式与系统级适配","id":"高对比度模式与系统级适配"},{"level":2,"text":"非文本元素的对比度要求","id":"非文本元素的对比度要求"},{"level":2,"text":"工程验证工具与自动化","id":"工程验证工具与自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态字体与响应式文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns/dynamic-type-responsive-text"},"next":{"title":"iOS 无障碍 API 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/implementation/ios-accessibility-api"}}